<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:52:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>大脑图谱框架揭示了疼痛和看电影期间信息流的变化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/brain-mapping-framework-reveals-shifts-in-information-flow-during-pain-and-movie-watching</link><description>在大脑中，信息在分布式网络之间传播，这些网络是相互关联的区域组，这些区域协同工作并促成特定的行为、感觉或想法。为了研究信息在不同条件下如何通过这些网络传播，许多神经科学家依靠功能磁共振成像（fMRI），这是一种非侵入性成像技术，可测量与神经活动间接相关的血氧变化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-mapping-framework-reveals-shifts-in-information-flow-during-pain-and-movie-watching2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:52:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/brain-mapping-framework-reveals-shifts-in-information-flow-during-pain-and-movie-watching</guid></item><item><title>工程益生菌在肿瘤内产生抗癌药物</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/engineered-probiotic-bacteria-produce-cancer-drugs-inside-tumors</link><description>未煮熟的肉类中的大肠杆菌会引起腹泻和食物中毒。然而，科学家们找到了一种方法，可以将细菌转变为一种输送剂，将药物直接输送到肿瘤，并将其转变为一个微小的癌症药物药房。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/engineered-probiotic-bacteria-produce-cancer-drugs-inside-tumors2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/engineered-probiotic-bacteria-produce-cancer-drugs-inside-tumors</guid></item><item><title>微生物感染与免疫系</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/department-of-microbial-infection-and-immunity-and</link><description>2 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/department-of-microbial-infection-and-immunity-and.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:22:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/department-of-microbial-infection-and-immunity-and</guid></item><item><title>我认为 iPhone Duo 正在解决华为已经解决的问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/i-think-the-iphone-duo-is-solving-a-problem-huawei-already-solved</link><description>苹果公司在铰链上花费了数年时间，一款没有移动部件的宽屏手机已经在中国的排行榜上名列前茅。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/i-think-the-iphone-duo-is-solving-a-problem-huawei-already-solved.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:07:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/i-think-the-iphone-duo-is-solving-a-problem-huawei-already-solved</guid></item><item><title>凯文·凯利谈生活的智慧和优秀建议</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/kevin-kelly-on-wisdom-and-excellent-advice-for-living</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/kevin-kelly-on-wisdom-and-excellent-advice-for-living.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:52:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/kevin-kelly-on-wisdom-and-excellent-advice-for-living</guid></item><item><title>反黑洞是否可能存在？我们如何判断我们是否正在观察一个黑洞？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/are-anti-black-holes-possible-and-how-could-we-tell-if-we-were-looking-at-one</link><description>一位读者认为答案是肯定的，并给出了我们发现它们的方法&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/are-anti-black-holes-possible-and-how-could-we-tell-if-we-were-looking-at-one.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/are-anti-black-holes-possible-and-how-could-we-tell-if-we-were-looking-at-one</guid></item><item><title>人工智能发现隐藏的人类蛋白质及其功能</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-finds-hidden-human-proteins-and-their-function</link><description>一项新的研究表明，人工智能与先进的实验科学相结合，可以帮助找到人体内“隐藏”和未探索的蛋白质，并揭示它们的实际作用。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-finds-hidden-human-proteins-and-their-function2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:22:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-finds-hidden-human-proteins-and-their-function</guid></item><item><title>多酚摄入量较高的老年人出现轻度认知障碍的可能性较小</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/older-adults-with-higher-polyphenol-intake-were-less-likely-to-have-mild-cognitive-impairment</link><description>在一项针对 92 名意大利记忆诊所老年患者的横断面研究中，膳食（多）酚和几个特定亚类的习惯性摄入量较高与轻度认知障碍 (MCI) 的可能性较低相关。总（多）苯酚摄入量与认知测试表现或循环炎症生物标志物无关，作者警告说，小型观察性研究无法确定因果关系。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/older-adults-with-higher-polyphenol-intake-were-less-likely-to-have-mild-cognitive-impairment.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:07:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/older-adults-with-higher-polyphenol-intake-were-less-likely-to-have-mild-cognitive-impairment</guid></item><item><title>科学家发明了一种像针一样细的大脑植入物，可以同时完成三项工作</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-create-a-needle-thin-brain-implant-that-can-do-three-jobs-at-once</link><description>一种新的针状细脑植入物可以记录神经活动、输送药物并使用单根柔性纤维刺激多个大脑区域。在小鼠身上进行的成功测试表明，它可以为科学家提供一种更精确、侵入性更小的方法来研究大脑，并最终可能有助于治疗癫痫等神经系统疾病。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-create-a-needle-thin-brain-implant-that-can-do-three-jobs-at-once.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:52:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-create-a-needle-thin-brain-implant-that-can-do-three-jobs-at-once</guid></item><item><title>干细胞逆转小鼠中风损伤并恢复运动能力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stem-cells-reverse-stroke-damage-and-restore-movement-in-mice</link><description>苏黎世大学的研究人员表示，干细胞移植可能能够修复中风造成的损伤。在小鼠实验中，这种治疗方法有助于产生新的神经元，恢复运动，并引发几种其他形式的大脑修复，为神经损伤的再生治疗迈出了有希望的一步。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/stem-cells-reverse-stroke-damage-and-restore-movement-in-mice.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stem-cells-reverse-stroke-damage-and-restore-movement-in-mice</guid></item></channel></rss>